<title>SINGAPORE: Hotel Malaysia 1996 net up 7.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Hotel Malaysia 1996 net up 7.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months ended Sept 30 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   13.35   vs   12.45</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)     80.90   vs   75.50</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	   35.00   vs   35.00</p>
<p>    Turnover		     55.04   vs   57.38</p>
<p>    Investment income	  18.69   vs   22.65</p>
<p>    Interest income	     1.46   vs    0.60</p>
<p>    Pretax			 18.22   vs   17.59</p>
<p>    Tax			     4.86   vs    5.14</p>
<p>Div pay/register - January 9 1997, December 27 1996</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Hotel Malaysia Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080 ds ne</p>
